k.\nKeep the switch.\n\nPaste a job email. Ledgerly's actual Python rules extract line items, flag uncertainty and prepare an in-memory invoice draft. You choose if the sandbox invoice is sent, whether a webhook is trusted and if an overdue reminder is approved.\n\nNO MODEL CALL\nNO PAYPAL NETWORK\nNO REAL MONEY\nRUNTIME / WASM\nPython, in this tab.\n\nPyodide runs Ledgerly source modules on the page. Close or reset to discard this sandbox ledger.\n\nPython engine loaded\n\nThe sandbox stays in this tab. Close or reset it to discard its ledger.\n\n01 / INTAKE\n\nBring a job email.\n\nTry a fictional fixture or paste your own non-sensitive text. The app never saves the source email.\n\nFICTIONAL FIXTURE\nUSD / hourly\nTwo currencies\nMissing recipient\nDeposit already paid\nUntrusted email text\nLoad example\nJOB EMAIL / PASTE HERE\nAnalyze with Python rules\nRULE EXTRACTOR / REAL OUTPUT\n90% confidence\nrules\nPriya Nair\npriya@orbitlabs.example\nCURRENCY\nUSD\nTERMS\nNET 30 DAYS\nLINE ITEM\tQTY\tCCY\tUNIT\nReact development\t20 hours\tUSD\t95\nLocalisation QA\t6 hours\tEUR\t60\nEXTRACTED TOTAL\tEUR 360\nUSD 1900\nWARNING / currency\nMultiple currencies ['EUR', 'USD']; a PayPal invoice has one currency_code, so this will be split into 2 invoices.\n\nErrors or low extraction confidence block drafting. Open the correction form to check the details yourself.\n\nReview or correct invoice fields\nCreate sandbox draft\n\n02 / HUMAN GATE\n\nNothing sends itself.\n\nInvoice sends and reminders appear here as pending actions. The Python GatedClient blocks them until you approve.\n\nSEND INVOICE\nINV2-MOCK-0001-01A6\n\nSend invoice LDG-0001 for EUR 360 to priya@orbitlabs.example\n\nReview queued invoice\nInvoice\nLDG-0001\nRecipient\nPriya Nair · priya@orbitlabs.example\nFrom\nLedgerly Demo · freelancer@example.test\nInvoice date\n2026-10-08\nPayment terms\nNet 30 days\nDue date\n2026-11-07\nPrior payment reported\nEUR 0\nQueued invoice items\nItem\tQuantity\tUnit price\nLocalisation QA\t6 hr\tEUR 60.00\nInvoice note\nThank you for your business.\nApprove in sandbox\nReject\nSEND INVOICE\nINV2-MOCK-0002-9F37\n\nSend invoice LDG-0002 for USD 1,900 to priya@orbitlabs.example\n\nReview queued invoice\nInvoice\nLDG-0002\nRecipient\nPriya Nair · priya@orbitlabs.example\nFrom\nLedgerly Demo · freelancer@example.test\nInvoice date\n2026-10-08\nPayment terms\nNet 30 days\nDue date\n2026-11-07\nPrior payment reported\nUSD 0\nQueued invoice items\nItem\tQuantity\tUnit price\nReact development\t20 hr\tUSD 95.00\nInvoice note\nThank you for your business.\nApprove in sandbox\nReject\n\n03 / SANDBOX LEDGER\n\nPayment, then follow-up.\n\nSimulate payment webhooks, advance the local demo clock and draft an overdue reminder.\n\nDEMO DATE\nAdvance clock\nScan overdue\nOPTIONAL PARTIAL PAYMENT\nReplay last webhook\nLDG-0001\nPriya Nair\nDRAFT\nEUR 360\nPAID 0\nBALANCE 360\nDUE 2026-11-07\nREMINDERS 0\nInvoice details · sandbox record\nLDG-0002\nPriya Nair\nDRAFT\nUSD 1900\nPAID 0\nBALANCE 1900\nDUE 2026-11-07\nREMINDERS 0\nInvoice details · sandbox record\n\nSandbox clock at snapshot: 2026-10-08\n\nRead-only copy from this tab’s in-memory sandbox. Opening details makes no provider request.\n\nInvoice reference\nINV2-MOCK-0002-9F37\nInvoice number\nLDG-0002\nSandbox provider status\nDRAFT\nRecipient\nPriya Nair\npriya@orbitlabs.example\nFrom\nLedgerly Demo\nfreelancer@example.test\nInvoice date\n2026-10-08\nPayment terms\nNet 30 days\nDue date\n2026-11-07\nInvoice items\nItem\tQuantity\tUnit\tUnit price\nReact development\t20\tHOURS\tUSD 95.00\nProvider invoice total\nUSD 1900.00\nProvider paid amount\nUSD 0.00\nProvider amount due\nUSD 1900.00\n\nAmounts and payment entries are copied from the sandbox provider record. The ledger summary above is the agent’s view; these values are not recalculated or combined across currencies.\n\nInvoice note\nThank you for your business.\n\nNo recorded sandbox payments.\n\n6 in-memory PayPal-style calls / 0 external calls\nReset sandbox\n\n04 / EVENT TRACE\n\nReplayable decisions.\n\nSummaries from Ledgerly's actual agent audit list; visitor text is not displayed here.\n\nqueued\nsend_invoice\n14:04:06\nqueued\nsend_invoice\n14:04:06\ntool\n14:04:06\ntool\n14:04:06\ntool\n14:04:06\n\nGate verified: an unapproved send was blocked. create_invoice -> 2 draft(s) created; awaiting approval to send; get_status -> INV2-MOCK-0001-01A6 is DRAFT; get_status -> INV2-MOCK-0002-9F37 is DRAFT\n\nLOCAL SANDBOX ONLY. RulePlanner + RulesExtractor run in Pyodide. PayPal behavior is the repository's in-memory SandboxMock, not a live PayPal integration. Do not paste confidential client data.\n\nPyodide 0.29.3 / MPL-2.0"},"pageErrors":[],"totalArtifactBytes":93025}
